==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[Li'l Zyclone]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Li'l Zyclone makes his UL debut in this stage, and he's here to make sure your attackers stay in one spot while Oldhorn lumbers his way to your base. Thankfully, Li'l Zyclone does as much damage as a loaded squirt gun, so you can use that to your advantage by stacking attackers. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] will be your powerhouses here, with [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]], and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Mina]] as the debuff squad. Feel free to add any offensive [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] if you like.

